    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/ba32e422f3ba10cc80da9174ccca71bf.webp?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...he's just been turned into a vampire. Well, actually, he has two problems, because he's also found himself on Fledgling Manor, the hottest vampire reality show in America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight new vampires are forced to live together in a remote mansion. Each episode, they must vote off one of their fellow Fledglings. But the losing contestant isn't just forced to leave the show \u2014 they're executed for the pleasure of the viewing audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Rocky live long enough to figure out what happened to him? How will he deal with his fellow Fledglings? <strong>Find out in Fledgling Manor, a supernatural horror visual novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/f8bedb8f0ae3319ad9644f76b44aa392.webp?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three romance-able characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 120,000 words long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight different characters to get to know and condemn to death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking black and white visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by kendall :3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three routes, each with unique CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half a dozen possible endings (including some bad ends ;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/e92fcbd29cde275275e1ed31eb69dcf6.webp?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/9c20998cf4232114c19908f06e545ddf.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our  <strong>Protagonist</strong> is a grocery delivery app driver, avid reality show viewer, and former bass player for a local metal band. He's also the proud owner of a white 2004 Toyota Corolla! But Rocky was turned into a vampire under mysterious circumstances... How did he get here!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/b5bd1e6fb22947ec4297d52507d29d42.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possible Love Interest</strong> Aanya hunted the streets of Atlanta for victims while dressed as a nurse before she was caught and put on <i>Fledgling Manor</i>. What's hiding behind her warm exterior?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/d73af7a7c535e02f5fe57b51a9aad9ec.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possible Love Interest</strong> Eight has a mysterious past, a creepy mask, and... a very friendly personality! Where did they come from, and why are they here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/7a5407d194ec26c804b76f54c1e0a508.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possible Love Interest</strong> Stefan doesn't understand TV shows and certainly doesn't want to be part of one. Get out of his way. He's got hunting to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ALSO FEATURING:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tay (22) a Christianity and candles influencer, Grace (50) a corporate girlboss, Jason (24) a grindset hunk, Lilia (23) a sad Canadian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with special appearances by Niko and Bug, from artist+character designer Shaydh's comic <i>And the Streets Awash in Blood</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/ba32e422f3ba10cc80da9174ccca71bf.webp?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...he's just been turned into a vampire. Well, actually, he has two problems, because he's also found himself on Fledgling Manor, the hottest vampire reality show in America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight new vampires are forced to live together in a remote mansion. Each episode, they must vote off one of their fellow Fledglings. But the losing contestant isn't just forced to leave the show \u2014 they're executed for the pleasure of the viewing audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Rocky live long enough to figure out what happened to him? How will he deal with his fellow Fledglings? <strong>Find out in Fledgling Manor, a supernatural horror visual novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/f8bedb8f0ae3319ad9644f76b44aa392.webp?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three romance-able characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 120,000 words long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight different characters to get to know and condemn to death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking black and white visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by kendall :3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three routes, each with unique CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half a dozen possible endings (including some bad ends ;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/e92fcbd29cde275275e1ed31eb69dcf6.webp?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/9c20998cf4232114c19908f06e545ddf.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our  <strong>Protagonist</strong> is a grocery delivery app driver, avid reality show viewer, and former bass player for a local metal band. He's also the proud owner of a white 2004 Toyota Corolla! But Rocky was turned into a vampire under mysterious circumstances... How did he get here!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/b5bd1e6fb22947ec4297d52507d29d42.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possible Love Interest</strong> Aanya hunted the streets of Atlanta for victims while dressed as a nurse before she was caught and put on <i>Fledgling Manor</i>. What's hiding behind her warm exterior?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/d73af7a7c535e02f5fe57b51a9aad9ec.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possible Love Interest</strong> Eight has a mysterious past, a creepy mask, and... a very friendly personality! Where did they come from, and why are they here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238510/extras/7a5407d194ec26c804b76f54c1e0a508.avif?t=1734467760\" width=577 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possible Love Interest</strong> Stefan doesn't understand TV shows and certainly doesn't want to be part of one. Get out of his way. He's got hunting to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ALSO FEATURING:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tay (22) a Christianity and candles influencer, Grace (50) a corporate girlboss, Jason (24) a grindset hunk, Lilia (23) a sad Canadian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with special appearances by Niko and Bug, from artist+character designer Shaydh's comic <i>And the Streets Awash in Blood</i>.</p>",
